<!-- SCOPE: all apps + all packages -->

# Naming Conventions

- **Language**: always English in code. Spanish is allowed only in UI-facing text and copy.
- **Variables, functions, parameters, hooks**: camelCase.
- **React components**: PascalCase — one component per file, filename matches the component name.
- **Interfaces**: PascalCase with prefix `I` (e.g. `IPost`).
- **Type aliases**: PascalCase with prefix `T` (e.g. `TApiResponse<T>`).
- **Enums**: PascalCase, no prefix (e.g. `PostStatus`).
- **Custom hooks**: camelCase with prefix `use` (e.g. `useAuth`, `usePosts`).
- **Redux slices**: camelCase with suffix `Slice` (e.g. `authSlice`, `uiSlice`).
- **TanStack Query keys**: defined as `const` arrays in a dedicated `query-keys.ts` file, camelCase (e.g. `postKeys`).
- **Folders**: kebab-case.
- **Files**:
  - Components: `PascalCase.tsx` (e.g. `PostCard.tsx`).
  - Hooks, utils, services, stores: kebab-case (e.g. `use-auth.ts`, `api-client.ts`).
  - Types: kebab-case with suffix `.types.ts` (e.g. `post.types.ts`).
  - Constants: kebab-case with suffix `.constants.ts`.
- **CSS / Tailwind**: utility-first; no custom class names unless encapsulating a repeated pattern via `@apply` in a dedicated `.css` module.

## Imports in the monorepo

| Situation | Correct form | Incorrect form |
|---|---|---|
| Import from an internal package | `@repo/ui`, `@repo/lib` | `../../packages/ui/src/...` |
| Import within the same app | `@/modules/...`, `@/lib/...` | `../../../lib/...` |
| Import from one app into another | **Forbidden** | `../../apps/admin/src/...` |
| Import from an app into packages | **Forbidden** | `../../apps/admin/src/store` |

```typescript
// ✅ correct — internal package import
import { LoadingSpinner } from '@repo/ui/components/feedback/LoadingSpinner';
import type { IApiResponse } from '@repo/lib/api/api-response.types';

// ✅ correct — internal import within the app
import { useAuth } from '@/modules/auth/hooks/use-auth';
import { ROUTES } from '@/lib/constants/routes.constants';

// ❌ incorrect — relative path between apps or into packages
import { LoadingSpinner } from '../../../packages/ui/src/components/...';
import { store } from '../../admin/src/store'; // from packages
```

## Internal package names

Packages under `packages/` follow the pattern `@repo/<kebab-name>`:

```
@repo/ui      → packages/ui
@repo/lib     → packages/lib
@repo/config  → packages/config
```
